// A pose-only line whose pose changes again before any line shows.

@actor mira
    name: Mira
    poses: neutral, happy, sad

== kitchen.door
mira (sad):
// PIB5010
mira (happy): The silent pose change above is never seen.

// Must not trigger

== kitchen.cellar
mira (sad):
@wait 1s
mira (happy): The sad pose showed during the wait.
mira (sad):
mira: Someone speaks, so the sad pose shows.
mira (sad):
@call kitchen.door
mira (happy): After a call, the pose may have changed.
